<title>CHINA: China Jan-April sugar imports slump 41.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-April sugar imports slump 41.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 130,000 tonnes of sugar in the first four months of this year, down 41.8 percent from the same 1996 period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	    IMPORTS JAN-APRIL     APRIL    YR/YR PCT CHANGE</p>
<p> Sugar	130,000		 80,000    -41.8</p>
<p>	    EXPORTS JAN-APRIL     APRIL    YR/YR PCT CHANGE</p>
<p> Sugar	 62,718		 27,423     -76.9</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
